# Secure login System - Code Over View
This Python project implements a secure login system using SQLite for storage and bcrypt for password hashing. It demonstrates secure coding practices for authentication.

## Features
- User Registration with strong password validation
- Secure Login using bcrypt hash verification
- SQLite database storage (no plain-text passwords)
- Interactive menu for Register, Login, Exit

## Security Highlights
- Passwords stored as bcrypt hashes (never plain text)
- Parameterized SQL queries prevent SQL injection
- Password strength rules enforced

